  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Profiling and Characterization of Conservation Agriculture Practices and Adoption in Guinea Savanna,</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the assignment is seek FAO?s technical assistance to characterize the level of CA practices and adoption in the aforementioned Regions and propose or recommend appropriate CA model (s) that meet the needs of smallholders for adoption as well as an implementation framework of the GASIP CA componenet. In addition, facilitate the engagement and leveraging of Department of Agriculture on the current and planned CA activities in line with GASIP CA implementation</narrative>
  </description>
